<title>UK: Abbey National sets 1.0 bln mark six-year bond.</title>
<headline>Abbey National sets 1.0 bln mark six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABBEY NATIONAL PLC</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.625     MATURITY    30.SEP.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.665   PAY DATE    30.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.625     REOFFER    99.315    SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.85	LIST FEE    0.50</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BUND 8.0 PCT JULY 2002</p>
<p> NOTES	BORROWER IS ABBEY NATIONAL TREASURY SERVICES,</p>
<p>		GUARANTEED BY ABBEY NATIONAL PLC</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
